</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><b>SIGNATURE OF AUTHORIZED REPRESENTATIVE IN THE
UNITED STATES</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Pursuant to the Securities Act&#160;of&#160;1933
as amended, the undersigned, the duly authorized representative in the United&#160;States of America of Siyata Mobile Inc., has signed
this registration statement on October 10<sup>th</sup>, 2023.</p><div>
